{"id":"u-7aa1b121-8150-44da-ab69-f49ca88ec323","src":"community","title":"David Inspired Greek Ideal Workout","author":"Reyes Saúl  F.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/O2dP2T-david-inspired-greek-ideal-workout","desc":"This 12-week training program is designed to develop an athletic and aesthetic physique through a structured full-body system performed 3 times per week.\nThe focus is on building a strong V-taper (shoulders and lats), improving overall strength, and developing a balanced, symmetrical physique while maintaining joint health and long-term sustainability.\n\nThe program uses a combination of compound lifts, hypertrophy work, and targeted accessory exercises to maximize muscular development with minimal effective volume. It includes planned progression, deloading phases, and controlled intensity to ensure consistent improvement without excessive fatigue.\n\nIn addition to strength and hypertrophy, the program emphasizes posture, scapular control, and muscular balance through dedicated shoulder health and rotator cuff work, ensuring long-term durability and performance. \n\nThis system is designed for individuals who want a disciplined, structured approach to building an athletic physique rather than random workouts, with clear progression and repeatable training patterns over 12 weeks.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":21,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-31T14:55:33.418Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"High Bar Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"